Package: ak620-linux
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCHITECTURE@
Maintainer: AK620 Linux contributors <noreply@example.invalid>
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.36), libgcc-s1, libwayland-client0, libxkbcommon0, libegl1, libgl1, passwd, dbus, acl
Recommends: systemd, udev
Description: Linux display support for DeepCool AK620 DIGITAL PRO
 Unprivileged USB HID display daemon and KDE-compatible settings/tray client
 for the DeepCool AK620 DIGITAL PRO. ARGB control is intentionally excluded.
